# Backend

Owned by **Stage 4**. Authoritative document: `.standards/workflow/stage-4-backend/backend/checklist.md`.

## Read the stack document first

The layer documents `01`–`20` are **technology-agnostic**. They are mapped onto concrete libraries, annotations, and idioms by exactly one stack document:

```
.standards/workflow/stage-4-backend/backend/21-tech-stack/PROMPT.md
.standards/workflow/stage-4-backend/backend/21-tech-stack/<stack>/CREATE-<stack>.md
```

Load the stack document for this project **before** any layer doc and before writing code. If the project has not selected one, ask — do not infer a stack from what happens to be in the build file.

